SUMMARY:FUN RIDE - LV Lititz Ice Cream Ride (19R) RSVP Required
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nRide leader: Volunteer to
  lead!\nRide Sweep: Volunteer to Sweep\nAnticipated Average Pace: \\~11 mp
 h\nRoute: [LV Lititz Ice Cream Ride (19R)](https://routes.lancasterbikeclu
 b.net/cue/lv-lititz-ice-cream-ride-19r-2/)\n\n**Be Safe\, Have Fun\, and R
 ide Together**\n\nWithout a volunteer leader\, this event is Show and Go.\
 nThe departure location is the same as the Tour de Red Rose\, just an hour
  later\, so there will be other cyclists to help but on a different route.
 \nIf you want to volunteer to lead\, leave a comment for this ride\, or co
 ntact Rick Zook.\n\nThis is a FUN RIDE ride. The ride leader will ride at 
 the advertised average speed. This is intended to be a group ride with a n
 o-drop rule as the main goal. The ride leader will do his/her best to keep
  the group together with occasional regroupings and/or splitting into mult
 iple groups to align to pace capabilities.\n\nPlease do not join this ride
  if you are not willing to ride with the group.\n\nHelmets are mandatory. 
 No earbuds. Please bring water and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire l
 evers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nTo eliminate passing around a pen and paper
  waiver\, we require LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP below to join thi
 s ride. Being on Meetup does not mean you are a club member. Join here [Me
 mber Signup](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&clu
 b_id=257148)\nYour RSVP is your agreement to abide by the club's Code of C
 onduct: [Code of Conduct](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?p
 age_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984)\n\nGuidance if an incident occu
 rs: [Incident Actions](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=
 22&club_id=257148&module_id=326137)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3154876
 48/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260630T182345Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260630T182345Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
